              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Julie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved it. I used 8 c. of peaches, decreased the white sugar to 1c. and added 1/2 tsp cinnamon to both the peach mixture and the topping. Also used old fashioned (not quick) oats. It was so good and gone so quickly I had to make another one 2 days later!",
